   "changed": "Only the workspace parts are kept: the members are the 4 ported crates in crates/ and the new sqll binary crate (crates/sqll), the workspace dependencies that they use, and the release profile. The workspace version is the sqll version. New: serde_json and sha2 (for build.rs of sqll_dialects), and opt-level 3 for sha2. No root package, no feature \"python\", no pyo3."
  },
